{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PillSignal 是一款用於日常服藥管理的提醒與紀錄工具，適合需要長期服藥、同時處理多種藥物或容易忘記服藥的人士。程式現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99，主打清晰簡單的操作流程。它只提供提醒與紀錄功能，不會提供醫療建議、診斷或治療方案，實際用藥安排仍須依從醫生與藥劑師的指示。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-281.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>清晰檢視每日服藥安排</h2>\n<p>PillSignal 可為藥丸、膠囊、藥水與注射劑等設定提醒時間，並將每次服藥標記為已服用、已跳過或稍後提醒。主畫面集中顯示當日所有服藥安排，另可記錄剩餘藥量並在需要補充時收到提示，亦可翻查服藥歷史，或將藥物清單與紀錄匯出成 PDF。所有資料只存放於裝置，毋須申請帳號。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-291-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-292-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-293-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-294-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-295-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-296-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：PillSignal</li><li>應用類別：Medical</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pillsignal/id6770604970?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T02:43:50.556639+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T02:17:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:54:31.593600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T02:37:26.042662+00:00","content_hash":"97bcd5fae4d0bfab361a9f10913f1ed10b52803728e0f3c99ed35e4cc154e61e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}